      "locked": false,
      "text": "Updated from the original thesis activity diagrams (only AD001/005/007/008/010/011 existed) to cover all 15 flows from the sequence diagrams, with swimlanes per responsible component. Black arrows = sequential flow, green = continue/happy path, red = fail/exit path.",
